{"id":"707325cb0230c081","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md","title":"Sobolev 延拓域及商类线性运算","display":"df-sobolev-extension-domain — Sobolev 延拓域及商类线性运算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sobolev-extension-domain","aliases":["58-df-sobolev-extension-domain"],"display":"df-sobolev-extension-domain — Sobolev 延拓域及商类线性运算","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sobolev-extension-domain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sobolev-extension-domain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sobolev-extension-domain — Sobolev 延拓域及商类线性运算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty]\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}\">\\(W^{k,p}\\)</span>、其范数、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span> 均取自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 为非空的可测函数 a.e. 等价类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n)\\)</span> 由下式定义，采用同一测度的商类运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\Omega=W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W_\\Omega=W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n=W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(W_n=W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtensionDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtensionDomain}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S\\)</span> 是同一四参数名称的字体变体。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|u\\|_{W_\\Omega}=\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\">\\(\\|u\\|_{W_\\Omega}=\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|v\\|_{W_n}=\\|v\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)}\">\\(\\|v\\|_{W_n}=\\|v\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)}\\)</span>；两者均为上述依赖的范数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeEqual}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeEqual}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}linear\\text{-}combination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega:\\exists f\\in u\\;\\exists g\\in v\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(h,\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\};\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}linear\\text{-}combination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega:\\exists f\\in u\\;\\exists g\\in v\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(h,\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\};\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}extension\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists E\\in W_n^{W_\\Omega}\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall u,v\\in W_\\Omega\\;\nE(\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n))\n=\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,E(u),b,E(v),\\mathbb R^n,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in W_\\Omega\\;(\\|E(u)\\|_{W_n}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W_\\Omega})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in W_\\Omega\\;\\exists f\\in E(u)\\;\\exists g\\in u\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f\\upharpoonright\\Omega,g;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}extension\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists E\\in W_n^{W_\\Omega}\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall u,v\\in W_\\Omega\\;\nE(\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n))\n=\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,E(u),b,E(v),\\mathbb R^n,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in W_\\Omega\\;(\\|E(u)\\|_{W_n}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W_\\Omega})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in W_\\Omega\\;\\exists f\\in E(u)\\;\\exists g\\in u\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f\\upharpoonright\\Omega,g;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>延拓算子作用于 a.e. 商类，并与限制映射互为右逆；不把一个商类直接代入点值函数。定义不额外要求有界域或 Lipschitz 边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega_{>0}$、$k\\in\\omega$、$p\\in[1,\\infty]$，$\\Omega\\in\\tau_n$；$W^{k,p}$、其范数、$\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega$ 均取自 [[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AeEqual}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"u,v","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n)","display":false},{"tex":"W_\\Omega=W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"W_n=W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtensionDomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\|u\\|_{W_\\Omega}=\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\|v\\|_{W_n}=\\|v\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeEqual}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}linear\\text{-}combination}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\mathbb C^\\Omega:\\exists f\\in u\\;\\exists g\\in v\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(h,\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\Omega\\};\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}extension\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\\\\n&\\land\\exists E\\in W_n^{W_\\Omega}\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall u,v\\in W_\\Omega\\;\nE(\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,u,b,v,\\Omega,n))\n=\\mathrm{AeCombination}_S(a,E(u),b,E(v),\\mathbb R^n,n)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in W_\\Omega\\;(\\|E(u)\\|_{W_n}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W_\\Omega})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in W_\\Omega\\;\\exists f\\in E(u)\\;\\exists g\\in u\\;\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f\\upharpoonright\\Omega,g;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2402,"backlinks":[{"id":"212cd08391c68bb4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bfb4dca042a4697a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)$ 由 [[./58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md]] 定义；连续嵌入的定义本身不预设延拓算子存在。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md|58-df-sobolev-extension-domain]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","a1d034d5d39b4a14"]}